{
  "_doc": "NPC portraits: first regex (case-insensitive) matching the NPC's display name picks content/art/npcs/<key>.webp (640×640). A name matching `undead` is the risen corpse of that NPC: same portrait, drawn with the undead tint. Keys with no picture yet show no portrait.",
